coder › Fixed `normalizePath` on branch `fix-normalize-absolute-root`.

What changed:
- `src/path.ts`: tracks whether the input starts with `/`; `..` pops the previous segment only if there is a poppable (non-`..`) segment, otherwise it is absorbed for absolute paths and kept for relative paths; empty/`'.'` segments are skipped (collapses slash runs, drops `.`, drops trailing slash); `'/'` prefix is re-added; empty result becomes `'.'` (except root `/`).
